                "© 2026 Nico. All rights reserved. QuickOrbit is an independent project by Nico. Nico retains the original product concept in its concrete form, the concept, structure, user experience, specific technical implementation, source code created by Nico, original design, layout, text, original graphics, names and other original QuickOrbit components. Without Nico's express written permission, the specific QuickOrbit implementation may not be adopted, recreated, used as the basis for a substantially similar publication, or presented as someone else's own development, to the extent permitted by law. Rights to macOS, SF Symbols, third-party apps, trademarks or other third-party components remain with their respective owners.",
